:62.901354432438%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/No_image.svg/20px-No_image.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1\" data-file-height=\"1\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:10em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"font-size:80%;position:relative;top:-540px;left:-220px;\"><b>Stockholmslag</b><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span> <span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a>&#160;</span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span> <span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna_(damer)\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna (damer)\">Brommapojkarna</a>&#160;</span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span> <span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården</a>&#160;</span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span> <span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#0000FF; border:1px solid #aaa; text-align:center;\">&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_Fotboll_(damer)\" title=\"Hammarby Fotboll (damer)\">Hammarby</a>&#160;</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Damallsvenskan 2025.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Damallsvenskan 2025</b> var den 38:e säsongen av <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a>, Sveriges högsta division i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotboll\" title=\"Fotboll\">fotboll</a> för damer. <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damer)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damer)\">FC Rosengård</a></span> var de regerande mästarna, efter att ha vunnit sin 14:e titel under <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2024\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2024\">föregående säsong</a>. Klubben försvarade dock inte sin titel, utan hade istället sin sämsta säsong i historien.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2025&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2025&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Lag\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th>Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2024\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\"><img alt=\"Stockholms län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Skytteholms_IP\" title=\"Skytteholms IP\">Skytteholms IP</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Konstgr%C3%A4s\" title=\"Konstgräs\">Konstgräs</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4&#160;000\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Alings%C3%A5s_IF_FF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alingsås IF FF\">Alingsås IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6talands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Västra Götalands län\"><img alt=\"Västra Götalands län\" src=\"//u